    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are a strict JSON API.\n\nInput:\nArray of AI news items.\n\nEach item contains:\n\n* title\n* summary\n* source\n\nTASK:\n\nFilter items.\n\nKEEP ONLY:\n\n* AI products\n* AI models\n* AI tools\n* AI developer releases\n* AI agents\n* Open-source AI\n* AI productivity\n* Student useful AI\n* ChatGPT updates\n* LLM updates\n\nREMOVE:\n\n* healthcare\n* biology\n* biodefense\n* government\n* enterprise culture\n* business case studies\n* general announcements\n* duplicates\n\nRank:\nscore = impact × usefulness × recency\n\nReturn maximum 3 items.\n\nOutput schema EXACTLY:\n\n[\n{\n\"title\":\"\",\n\"summary\":\"\",\n\"why_it_matters\":\"\",\n\"difficulty\":\"Easy|Medium|Hard\",\n\"free_vs_premium\":\"Free|Premium|Mixed\",\n\"linkedin_angle\":\"\"\n}\n]\n\nRULES:\n\n* Output ONLY JSON\n* No markdown\n* No explanation\n* No notes\n* No text before JSON\n* No text after JSON\n* Summary ≤ 20 words\n* why_it_matters ≤ 12 words\n* linkedin_angle ≤ 10 words\n* If fewer than 3 valid topics exist → return fewer\n\nInput:\n\n{{ JSON.stringify($input.all().map(i => i.json)) }}\n",
        "batching": {}
      },
