    {
      "parameters": {
        "prompt": "=You are an expert LinkedIn AI Content Strategist.\n\nYou receive ONE selected AI topic.\n\nInput:\n{{ JSON.stringify($json) }}\n\nYour task:\n\nConvert the selected topic into a high-quality LinkedIn post.\n\nRules:\n\n- Use ONLY the selected topic.\n- Write naturally.\n- Avoid clickbait.\n- Keep professional tone.\n- Description should be 120–180 words.\n- Hook must be ≤15 words.\n- Insights must contain exactly 3 bullets.\n- CTA must be one short sentence.\n- Maximum 5 hashtags.\n- No markdown.\n- No explanation.\n- Output JSON only.\n\nOutput format:\n\n{\n\"linkedin_title\":\"\",\n\"hook\":\"\",\n\"description\":\"\",\n\"insights\":[\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\"\n],\n\"cta\":\"\",\n\"hashtags\":[\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\",\n\"\"\n],\n\"image_prompt\":\"\"\n}\n\nField rules:\n\nlinkedin_title:\nShort professional title.\n\nhook:\nStrong opening.\n\ndescription:\nExplain:\n1. What happened\n2. Why it matters\n3. Practical takeaway\n\ninsights:\nExactly 3 concise bullets.\n\ncta:\nInvite discussion.\n\nhashtags:\nAI related only.\n\nimage_prompt:\nGenerate professional LinkedIn cover image instructions."
      },
